# AGENTS.md

## Project Purpose
- This repository contains a Cargo-AI project scaffold.
- Keep changes deterministic and reproducible.

## Recommended Workflow
- Validate frequently: `cargo check`
- Keep docs and behavior aligned when command behavior changes.
- Prefer targeted tests for changed paths before broad test runs.

## Collaboration Notes
- Keep PR/commit summaries focused on behavioral deltas.
- Treat generated artifacts as outputs; keep source templates as the canonical input.
